#
# What the demos make while they run, and the one file that holds secrets.
# local/.state/ holds the PostgreSQL data directory and its password file, the
# generated robinauts.toml, the server's log and its pid file: everything
# demo/local/stop.sh --reset deletes. (The containers keep theirs in Docker.)
.state/

# demo/.env: the model provider key, the GitHub token and the containers'
# database password, read by demo/local/start.sh and demo/compose/start.sh
# when it is mode 0600. It is never committed, and neither demo writes to it.
.env
